selected.\n- After selection, sort selected by start to get selected_call_ids. Also sort by start descending for replacement order.\n- Apply replacements: start with tokens = list(case['tokens']). For each call in sorted selected by start descending: start, end, replacement_tokens. tokens = tokens[:start] + replacement_tokens + tokens[end:].\n\nReturn dict.\n\nWe'll produce Python code in a string, then wrap in {\"implementation\": \"...\"}. Escape properly.\n\nMake sure to use standard library only. No imports needed (maybe typing but not necessary). We'll define solve(case).\n\nLet's write the code."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1654,"completion_tokens":1542,"total_tokens":3196,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1536},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":875},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":1536,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":118},"system_fingerprint":"fp_8b330d02d0_prod0820_fp8_kvcache_20260402"}